              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala waawutmo Daudi Arauna guri báy, «Aasla'áy, kuúng mindi gaa haniisaar. Aníng an tlaáxw ar hariímár tlaxoorós. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúeé' u ilahhooár da/tií haniisaaká ar naa hamér wa xintsiiká.» Daudi kitangwduú balaangw muxta guri tlaáxw ar shekeéli mibeeri kooán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guri kitángw ilahhooárií tleéhh didár afeenidár balaangw muxta. Ilahhooár da/a gari haniís, nee ilahhooár wayduwo. Naagáy AAKOÓ MUNGÚ firoorí gari ya/án as yaamu, nee oohaseeyidár tiqtír pu/i ar múk Israeli gwa ot, gari har'óh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.25"
            ]
